# SinDifference: real difference-angle identity.
# Gate: target/release/litex -strict -f examples/proof_nodes/equal/by_builtin_rule/sin_difference.lit
# Previously rejected, exact legacy-positive source:
# forall x,y R:
#     sin(x-y) = sin(x)*cos(y)-cos(x)*sin(y)
forall x,y R:
    sin(x-y) = sin(x)*cos(y)-cos(x)*sin(y)
# Boundary: a plus sign or unrestricted complex arguments fail in Rust regressions.
